## Spec B7+B9 (docs/specs/syntax/async_lowering.spec.md Milestone 2B):
## a single `.await` site lowers to a two-state machine. State 0
## polls the sub-future; on Ready it bumps to state 1 and returns
## Poll.Ready(<post-await tail>). Sub-future is eagerly constructed
## in init.

async def make_int() -> Int
  42
end

async def f() -> Int
  let x = make_int().await
  x + 1
end
